Dialogue: 0,00:00:00.000,00:00:05.000,Default,,0,0,0,,SybilShield turns a social handle into a staked credential passport.
Dialogue: 0,00:00:05.000,00:00:08.000,Default,,0,0,0,,The passport is reviewed by validators, not by a backend opinion.
Dialogue: 0,00:00:08.000,00:00:12.000,Default,,0,0,0,,Free vouches and copied proof pages make reputation trivially farmable.
Dialogue: 0,00:00:12.000,00:00:16.000,Default,,0,0,0,,Sybil clusters recycle one identity across many wallets.
Dialogue: 0,00:00:16.000,00:00:20.000,Default,,0,0,0,,Applicants lock real SST. Peers vouch with real stake.
Dialogue: 0,00:00:20.000,00:00:24.000,Default,,0,0,0,,A challenger locks a bond equal to the stake before verification.
Dialogue: 0,00:00:24.000,00:00:28.000,Default,,0,0,0,,Validators fetch the proof page and must agree on three fields.
Dialogue: 0,00:00:28.000,00:00:32.000,Default,,0,0,0,,Anchor 0 slashes. 40 stays provisional. 75 verifies. 100 is Diamond.
Dialogue: 0,00:00:32.000,00:00:36.000,Default,,0,0,0,,Every liability stays in vault custody until settlement is claimed.
Dialogue: 0,00:00:36.000,00:00:40.000,Default,,0,0,0,,Rewards are paid only from slashed fraud, never minted per verification.
Dialogue: 0,00:00:40.000,00:00:44.000,Default,,0,0,0,,Live on studionet: 19 finalized transactions and 3 guard rollbacks.
Dialogue: 0,00:00:44.000,00:00:48.000,Default,,0,0,0,,Four way sha256 match. github.com/hoveiser/sybil-shield
